---
layout: page.njk
title: "Vibe Lounge"
description: "Build a working app with Gemini in one guided sprint. DevFest Berlin 2026 at SRH Berlin, Saturday 14 November, 11:00 to 15:00."
permalink: /vibe-lounge/
---

{% set lounge = site.agenda.vibeLounge %}

<img class="vibe-page-banner" src="/assets/images/vibe-lounge-banner.png" alt="DevFest 2026 Vibe Lounge" width="1600" height="893" fetchpriority="high">

<div class="vibe-page-lead">
    <p>Come build an app with Gemini! <span aria-hidden="true">🚀</span></p>
    <p>Saturday 14 November, 11:00 to 15:00, at {{ site.venue.name }}. <span aria-hidden="true">📍</span></p>
    <p>Bring your laptop, pick a challenge, and leave with an app you can share. <span aria-hidden="true">✨</span></p>
</div>

<div class="vibe-page-lines">
    <p>The Vibe Lounge is a relaxed room for building with Google AI Studio and Gemini. <span aria-hidden="true">🤍</span></p>
    <p>No coding experience needed. Every challenge starts simple, and you can keep going if you want more. <span aria-hidden="true">💪</span></p>
</div>

<p class="vibe-page-host">
    Hosted by <a href="{{ lounge.host.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ lounge.host.name }}</a>, {{ lounge.host.role }},
    with community mentors in the room.
</p>

<h2 id="sprints">When to come</h2>
<div class="vibe-page-lines">
    <p>Sprints start at 11:00, 13:00 and 14:00. Come at the start of one, so you build together with the room. <span aria-hidden="true">⏰</span></p>
    <p>The lounge takes a lunch break from 11:45 to 13:00. <span aria-hidden="true">🥪</span></p>
</div>

<div class="agenda-vibe-grid">
    {% for sprint in site.agenda.vibeLoungeSlots %}
    <div class="agenda-vibe-card">
        <div class="agenda-vibe-header">
            <span class="venue-badge">{{ sprint.slot }}</span>
            <span class="agenda-vibe-time">{{ sprint.time }}</span>
        </div>
        <h3>{{ sprint.title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ sprint.focus }} <span aria-hidden="true">{{ sprint.emoji }}</span></p>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
</div>

<h2 id="challenges">Pick a challenge</h2>
<div class="vibe-page-lines">
    <p>All four run in every sprint, and they are free for every DevFest attendee. <span aria-hidden="true">🤩</span></p>
    <p>Pick the one you like, or bring your own idea. Each one is sized for a single sprint. <span aria-hidden="true">😉</span></p>
</div>

<div class="vibe-challenge-grid">
    {% for challenge in lounge.challenges %}
    <div class="vibe-challenge-card">
        <span class="vibe-pill">{{ challenge.tag }}</span>
        <h3>{{ challenge.title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ challenge.summary }} <span aria-hidden="true">{{ challenge.emoji }}</span></p>
        <a class="vibe-challenge-link" href="{{ challenge.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ challenge.linkLabel }}</a>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
</div>

{% if lounge.repoUrl %}
<p class="vibe-page-repo">All challenges and the sprint flow in one place, to bookmark: <a href="{{ lounge.repoUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ lounge.repoUrl | replace("https://", "") }}</a> <span aria-hidden="true">📦</span></p>
{% endif %}

<h2 id="bring">What to bring</h2>
<ul>
    <li>Your own laptop. A phone works too, but switching between preview, code and prompts is much easier on a laptop. Work laptops often block what AI Studio needs. <span aria-hidden="true">💻</span></li>
    <li>A personal Google account (an @gmail.com address). Work and university accounts can block features or deployment. <span aria-hidden="true">🔑</span></li>
    <li>Your phone, to open your app and share it. <span aria-hidden="true">📱</span></li>
    <li>Your charger. <span aria-hidden="true">🔌</span></li>
</ul>
<p>Tip: sign in at <a href="https://ai.studio/build" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ai.studio/build</a> with your personal account before you come, so your sprint starts with building. <span aria-hidden="true">😉</span></p>

<h2 id="flow">How a sprint works</h2>
<ol>
    <li>Come in at the start of a sprint. A volunteer at the door checks you in and points you to a seat. <span aria-hidden="true">👋</span></li>
    <li>Open your challenge from this page and sign in at <a href="https://ai.studio/build" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ai.studio/build</a>. <span aria-hidden="true">💻</span></li>
    <li>Start from the challenge prompt, then add one feature per prompt. Stuck? Mentors are right there to help. <span aria-hidden="true">🤓</span></li>
    <li>Want to publish it? Deploy to Cloud Run from AI Studio, or use Share for a quick public link. With a personal account and no Google Cloud billing history, the free Starter Tier covers up to two Cloud Run projects. <span aria-hidden="true">🚀</span></li>
    <li>Show it and claim your badge. At the end of the sprint a few people demo their apps, and everyone can claim the official DevFest 2026 Vibe Lounge badge in the room. <span aria-hidden="true">🥳</span></li>
</ol>

<div class="vibe-page-lines">
    <p>Share what you built with <strong>#DevFest</strong>, we would love to see it! <span aria-hidden="true">🔥</span></p>
    <p>The whole day is on the <a href="/agenda/">agenda</a>.</p>
</div>
